<object id="legend" label="Legend&lt;br&gt;A: blue dashed — DNS queries and DNS traffic routing, port 53.&lt;br&gt;B: orange solid — HTTPS requests / routing, port 443, then API invocation.&lt;br&gt;Numbers are independent per flow; a/b/c selects dev/test/prod (one environment per request).&lt;br&gt;Filled arrow: caller → callee, or explicitly labeled infrastructure traffic routing.&lt;br&gt;Crossings are not junctions; distinct routes do not share segments.&lt;br&gt;Normal responses are folded into request labels. Boundaries identify architectural domains.&lt;br&gt;✓ = connected / allowed in the labeled matrix; unlisted rules are unspecified." annotationKind="legend"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="html=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9ca3af;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1710" width="900" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
